        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A bright and beautifully maintained two-bedroom, one-bathroom ground-floor apartment in the heart of Ringsend, offering dual-aspect East/West light throughout the day. The own door apartment benefits from a private patio off the kitchen, perfect for morning coffee or evening drinks as well as access to a stunning communal rooftop terrace with gorgeous views across the city. One designated secure underground parking space is included.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen was fully refurbished, a rare upgrade within the block, and the apartment has since been thoughtfully updated throughout. Upgraded wood flooring and bathroom wash basin.  A new dishwasher and fridge freezer (2025), new dining chairs, coffee table, mattress and kettle (2024), and brand-new bed, headboard, pillows, duvets and linens for both bedrooms (September 2026). New door and window seals were fitted in January 2026.\r\n\r\nOffered fully furnished with all appliances included. This is a genuine \"walk-in ready\" home. All you need to bring is your toothbrush.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2003, Shelbourne Park Apartments is a well-established and popular development in Ringsend, close to the Aviva Stadium, the Grand Canal Dock, and the city's Silicon Docks business district, with excellent transport links via Dart and bus routes into the city centre.\r\n\r\nManagement fee: €2,769 per annum"
      },
